title: Economic Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 12; month_actions += 1
view-if: dvp_in_government and (economic_minister_party == dvp_name or finance_minister_party == dvp_name) and economic_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/KrohneRudolf.jpg
#subtitle: Deregulation and privatization.

= Economic Policy

For us, economic policy involves deregulation and privatization.

- @deregulate_businesses
- @targeted_privatizations
- @sweeping_privatizations
- @return: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@deregulate_businesses
title: Deregulate businesses.
subtitle: Reduce state regulations over enterprises.
on-arrival: business_deregulation += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if spd_in_government; new_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 7*(1-dissent); workers_dvp -= 2; capital_strike_progress -= 1; labor_dissent += 5; industrialist_dissent -= 8; liberal_dissent -= 4; spd_relation -= 5; ddp_relation += 3; ddp_cohesion -= 1; economic_growth += 0.2 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 3

We have reduced regulations on strategic businesses, saving some from failure and encouraging growth on others. The economy benefits from this slightly, at the expense of our support among workers.

@targeted_privatizations
title: Targeted privatizations.
subtitle: Privatize nonessential services and unprofitable state-owned enterprises. [? if small_privatizations = 2: +1 budget ?]
on-arrival: small_privatizations += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if spd_in_government; new_middle_dvp -= 2; old_middle_dvp += 9*(1-dissent); workers_dvp -= 3; labor_dissent += 7; industrialist_dissent -= 12; ddp_cohesion -= 1; economic_growth += 0.2 if economic_growth < 5; unemployed += 0.5; budget += 1 if small_privatizations = 3
max-visits: 3

Transportation, prison service, parts of healthcare, small state-owned enterprises and others are transfered or sold to private investors. Our new middle class base, of which many are public servants, worry about losing their jobs, and we've noticed an uptick in unemployement.

@sweeping_privatizations
title: Make sweeping privatizations.
subtitle: Privatize as many things as possible. +1 budget
on-arrival: big_privatizations += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if dvp_majority == 0; new_middle_dvp -= 10; old_middle_dvp += 12*(1-dissent); workers_dvp -= 10; labor_dissent += 10; industrialist_dissent -= 18; industrialist_strength += 5; ddp_cohesion -= 1; new_middle -= 2; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 5; unemployed += 2; budget += 1
max-visits: 2

We have pushed through as much legislation as possible to sell our public services and enterprises. The new middle class leaves us in droves, and many of them, having lost their employment, are even ejected from their social class. Unemployment is also rising.

